+Use case: stylized-concept. Create one production-ready illustrated UI panel asset for Crownforge BOOMTOOTH. Match exactly the art direction of the supplied D1 reference (style reference only, never copy its layout or text): mature 2D comic cartoon, thick slightly irregular brush-black outlines 4–7px at 1024, thinner interior marks, clean two-tone cel shading and one sharp off-white highlight per volume, simple readable shapes, drawn squared wood grain, chipped blue-gray granite and riveted iron where applicable. Restrained saturated palette: burnt orange #E8742A, sky orange #F39A3C, pine #2F5D46/#1E3B2E, granite #6F7F92/#46526A, TNT red #D7332B, gold #F2B233, honey wood #C98A45, dark wood #6B4526, cream #F4E6C8, ink #1B1410. Warm late-afternoon light from left, blue-violet hard shadows. Absolutely no text, letters, numbers, logos, watermark, signature. No photorealism, smooth 3D, airbrush, blur, default gradients, generic neon, decorative outer effects. Front-facing centered isolated complete object, rounded corners, no crop. Real transparent alpha outside the object, no painted checkerboard, no white background, no halo, no cast shadow outside silhouette. Keep 3–6% safety margin around the entire subject. Crucial: a VERY LARGE central area must be opaque, perfectly uniform single flat color, EMPTY and calm for translated UI text; no grain, seams, scratches, shading or decorations inside that central area. Grain and details belong only on borders.
+Strict production cutout: exterior pixels alpha=0, interior alpha=255; no atmosphere or glow outside silhouette. Central writing field is a single solid flat fill, not a softly illuminated surface.
+Asset: panel-total. 1536x1024 landscape PNG. Large plank bonus total-winnings panel rimmed with gold and iron. At top center a SMALL medallion showing a little chipped blue-gray granite mountain sculpted into an original beaver face with one golden tooth. Stone chips and gold nuggets rest along bottom ledge. Very large rounded rectangular uniform honey-brown empty central field, rich drawn timber detail only on frame. Medallion and lower debris must not invade the central text area.
+CORRECTION: reduce entire object to 90 percent canvas width AND height. Mandatory minimum 60 pixels clear transparent padding on EVERY side, including mountain tip. Perfectly flat single solid central fill #C98A45, no vignette, no gradient, no atmospheric light. Small medallion stays entirely above central writing field.
